OL,4,B'Not the right time' - Fernandes       
OL,5,Bpauses Man Utd contract talks          
OL,6,GManchester United captain Bruno        
OL,7,GFernandes says he has been offered a   
OL,8,Gnew contract by the club but feels it  
OL,9,G"is not the right time" for            
OL,10,Gdiscussions about his future.          
OL,12,FThe 32-year-old midfielder is out of   
OL,13,Fcontract at the end of the season,     
OL,14,Fthough the club have the option to     
OL,15,Ftrigger a 12-month extension until     
OL,16,F2028.                                  
